      ‖compensatedPhysicalProbe η (calibrationForSet S hmax) W0 W1
          (fun i=> canonicalSlotSupport (T i)) W (fun i=> Z^(length i)) (Z^(17/48:ℝ)) (Z^(23/48:ℝ)) Z-
