  obtain ⟨C,hC,n,hn,hchoice⟩ := canonical_probe_exists_cube (ι:=RayQuotient.Characters M H)
    K e δ a b B ζ saving τ he he' hδ hδ' hζ hζ' hτ ha hb hB hβ
